{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d13","docs":{"io/output/d13/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Port physique D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.binding_port.label","help":"Identifiant du port physique piloté par la sortie D13. Utiliser \"Non connecté\" pour laisser cette sortie logique non affectée.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d13/d13_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D13 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_active_high.help"},"io/output/d13/d13_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D13.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d13/d13_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D13.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_momentary.help"},"io/output/d13/d13_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D13.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_name.help"},"io/output/d13/d13_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D13 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D13.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.d13_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d13/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D13","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D13 applique son état initial au démarrage ou tente de conserver le latch matériel lors d'un reboot chaud. Sur MCP23017, la conservation est ignorée et l'état initial est appliqué.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d13.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}